   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-16, iPhone screenshots of the current app and SwiftHFR, Favoris/Drapeaux and Messages)**\n\nToday's SwiftHFR rows, the **dense view**, move behind Réglages › Expérimental: the topic rows here, and also the MP list rows. By default the lists follow the current app (#817 for the topics, #900 for the MP rows).\n\nIn the experimental dense view:\n- **C.** On the first line, the topic starter's name is replaced by the **last poster's** name (as #857 asks for the lists).\n- **D.** The **message count** is removed (« 9075 réponses »).\n- **E.** The relative date drops « il y a » (« 14 minutes », « 2 semaines »), and the info line **never wraps**: it is cut with « … » when there is no room.\n- **F.** **Section titles in bold** (« Apple », « Video & Son », etc.). Today they do not look bold.\n\nTests: C, D and E as pure row-formatting rules (no « il y a », single-line truncation, last poster), and F as a font-weight check.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
   "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
