   "body": "/claim cloud/i905-sonnet\n\nOperator's go of 2026-11-16, grouped with #973 (one PR, `Closes #905` and `Closes #973`). Plan:\n- Rename the option `flagIconRows` to `denseRows` (« Lignes denses »), listed in Réglages › Expérimental; off by default, the default build is unchanged.\n- One pure formatter `DenseRowFormat` (Experimental/DenseRows/): last poster instead of the starter (C), no reply count (D), « il y a » dropped (E), one-line truncation « … », « ⚑ x / y » for MP groups (#973), Swift Testing, shown to fail without the change.\n- Topic rows: `TopicRowStyle.current` reads the option; `DenseTopicRowView` uses the formatter; section titles bold (F).\n- MP rows: `MessageRowView` dense branch (group and one-to-one) from the same formatter.\n- Draft PR with `compile-check`, adversarial review (Opus), max 3 rounds.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
